y</span><span style="color: #007700">());<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例的输出类似于：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">int(16)</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div></div>
 * 
         * Returns the current capacity.
         *
         * @return int
         *
         * @link https://www.php.net/manual/en/ds-map.capacity.php
         */
