style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.mixed.php" class="type mixed" style="color:#EAB766">mixed</a></span> <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">\$b</span></span>): <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.integer.php" class="type int" style="color:#EAB766">int</a></span></div><div class="caution"><strong class="caution">警告</strong> <p class="simpara">  从比较函数中返回<em>非整数</em>值，例如 <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.float.php" class="type float" style="color:#EAB766">float</a></span>，将导致内部强制转换为 callback 返回值为  <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.integer.php" class="type int" style="color:#EAB766">int</a></span>。因此，诸如 <span class="literal">0.99</span> 和 <span class="literal">0.1</span> 之类的值都将被转换为整数值  <span class="literal">0</span>，将这些值比较的话将会是相等。 </p></div>     </dd>      </dl> </div> <div class="refsect1 returnvalues" id="refsect1-ds-map.sorted-returnvalues">  <h3 class="title">返回值</h3>  <p class="para">    Returns a copy of the map, sorted by value.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 examples" id="refsect1-ds-map.sorted-examples">  <h3 class="title">示例</h3>  <div class="example" id="example-1">   <p><strong>示例 #1 <span class="function">{@link Ds\Map::sort()}</span> example</strong></p>   <div class="example-contents"><div class="phpcode" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: #000000"><span style="color: #9876AA">&lt;?php<br>\$map </span><span style="color: #007700">= new </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\Ds\Map</span><span style="color: #007700">([</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"a" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">2</span><span style="color: #007700">, </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"b" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">3</span><span style="color: #007700">, </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"c" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">1</span><span style="color: #007700">]);<br><br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">print_r</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$map</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">sorted</span><span style="color: #007700">());<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例的输出类似于：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">Ds\Map&nbsp;Object<br>(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[0]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;c<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[1]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;a<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[2]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;b<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;3<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>)</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div>  <div class="example" id="example-2">   <p><strong>示例 #2 <span class="function">{@link Ds\Map::sort()}</span> example using a comparator</strong></p>   <div class="example-contents"><div class="phpcode" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: #000000"><span style="color: #9876AA">&lt;?php<br>\$map </span><span style="color: #007700">= new </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\Ds\Map</span><span style="color: #007700">([</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"a" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">2</span><span style="color: #007700">, </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"b" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">3</span><span style="color: #007700">, </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"c" </span><span style="color: #007700">=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">1</span><span style="color: #007700">]);<br><br></span><span style="color: #FF8000">// Reverse<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$sorted </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$map</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">sorted</span><span style="color: #007700">(function(</span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$a</span><span style="color: #007700">, </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$b</span><span style="color: #007700">) {<br>    return </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$b </span><span style="color: #007700">&lt;=&gt; </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$a</span><span style="color: #007700">;<br>});<br><br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">print_r</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$sorted</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例的输出类似于：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">Ds\Map&nbsp;Object<br>(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[0]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;b<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;3<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[1]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;a<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[2]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Ds\Pair&nbsp;Object<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[key]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;c<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[value]&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br><br>)</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div></div>
